WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:09.860
Forms: forms customers fill in a chat or through a link (intake, booking, order…), their fields and their look.

2
00:00:10.408 --> 00:00:19.880
In "Forms" each form is a box; open it for "Edit" and "Archive". Make your own copy of a ready form with "Duplicate as editable".

3
00:00:20.433 --> 00:00:24.290
Or create a "New form" and add the questions from "Fields".

4
00:00:24.843 --> 00:00:29.200
In "Form design", set the colours and look of the form page.

5
00:00:29.749 --> 00:00:35.380
Put the form in a flow or automation; the answers are saved on that customer's record.

6
00:00:35.934 --> 00:00:41.150
Keep forms short; every extra question lowers how many people finish.
